Fail fast on Weaver and fall back to the Gatekeeper protector (rothko)

OrangeFox's vold waited forever for the AIDL Weaver service ("Trying
Decryption" never ended): on rothko Weaver runs on the NXP eSE through
OMAPI, which recovery cannot start. Check for the service instead of
waiting, and when the active protector fails, try every protector that
has Gatekeeper data, as TWRP does (patches/system_vold on the TWRP branch).
OrangeFox already speaks the AIDL Gatekeeper, so only the fallback and the
keystore alias fix are ported.

